.echo === HD successor continuity extra: one forced day of player turns ===
.echo Harness-only hidden-desktop probe for the approved_hidden_cdb_continuity class.
.echo The forced map route loads slot __LOAD_SLOT__. At the world-map loop site 0040B0C8
.echo the probe calls the native saveGame 004443E0 for slot __BEFORE_SLOT__. Then every
.echo 128 ticks it calls the native nextPlayer 0040AA60 with eax 0, edx 5 and ecx 0,
.echo at most five times, until the day word at gd+222f6 has advanced by one and
.echo player 0 is current again. Then it saves slot __AFTER_SLOT__. Each forced call
.echo keeps every general register and the flags in t6 t8 t9 t10 t11 t15 t16 t17 and
.echo its ESP in header padding, and restores them when the call returns to 0040B0C8
.echo with that ESP. The unacquired hidden mouse leaves stale button state. The day
.echo banner test 0040A943 and each release-wait test 004609E0 and 004609FC are
.echo observed for eight polls. Only then may that banner result become 1 or that
.echo button's release result become 0, once per banner or wait - disclosed, never input.
.echo Scratch in PE header padding free in every candidate: 004003C0 state, C4
.echo advances, C8 initial day, CC saved ESP, D0 last tick, D4 banner polls, D8
.echo release ESP, DC left polls, E0 override bits, E4 captured state, E8 right
.echo polls, EC release waits.
ed 004003c0 0
ed 004003c4 0
ed 004003c8 0
ed 004003cc 0
ed 004003d0 0
ed 004003d4 0
ed 004003d8 0
ed 004003dc 0
ed 004003e0 0
ed 004003e4 0
ed 004003e8 0
ed 004003ec 0
